#: scenario2:scenario2_0816F8A8_8018_45FF_9B57_AFFB54B576ED
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2dc92f48fbea40f47949727a2ef4d2c7c5a118c014d519da6cea6d49c0a0b439
#. default-sha256: 1737b850a73f0890eadf2cf3f30cbf7c0810d88011b5c6f2c25ea8fe8d1905e0
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_0816F8A8_8018_45FF_9B57_AFFB54B576ED"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫⟪k:31⟫⟪k:32⟫⟪k:33⟫"
"⟪k:34⟫⟪k:35⟫⟪k:36⟫⟪k:37⟫⟪k:38⟫⟪k:39⟫“The mansion sat in ruins in that era; not a soul resided "
"within.”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫⟪k:31⟫⟪k:32⟫⟪k:33⟫"
"⟪k:34⟫⟪k:35⟫⟪k:36⟫⟪k:37⟫⟪k:38⟫⟪k:39⟫“La villa era in rovina a quell’epoca; non vi abitava "
"un’anima.”"

#: scenario2:scenario2_7CFDEB4E_A156_46FB_89AF_CD8E115FF7DE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bb23b24a469a33b5d25c0fe5f0d34723ff3491a5b6c8969c40514660db0502e4
#. default-sha256: 7b988f10ae1a6b1d948b357b8bef29771e725d83e2aa62ad38eb4bbfa1a374b1
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_7CFDEB4E_A156_46FB_89AF_CD8E115FF7DE"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The grandeur of the house was lost to the ages. It was in perpetual decline."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Lo splendore della casa andò perso nei secoli. Era in perenne declino."

#: scenario2:scenario2_20224EB1_F2D4_47F8_AC9D_6A5486C7D60C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9ce72ef0158f8f65564d857b232d6d1b7732643c96a077107e0f8b85c4bd1dc2
#. default-sha256: a77aa9114baa8035022186b0ed29a19f31597a8c967e9586da5e625596c9fd1a
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_20224EB1_F2D4_47F8_AC9D_6A5486C7D60C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Not a flower grew in the garden; dust and dirt blackened the plaster; cobwebs blanketed the "
"corridors; ivy shrouded the outer walls. It was not a pleasant sight."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Nel giardino non cresceva alcun fiore; polvere e sporco annerivano l’intonaco; le ragnatele "
"ricoprivano i corridoi; l’edera aveva avvolto le mura esterne. Non era una vista piacevole."

#: scenario2:scenario2_7342F8BC_F997_4864_8E42_6708128E6634
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7b6a947420fd526b3e7c4a1fa7f182aea2bf535ce574157bff594189d3dfa4b8
#. default-sha256: 02d6c9bd4ac748ee06a2f660d9f9b168bbfdb0058ee4e3257aa0a3c8ebd6f230
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_7342F8BC_F997_4864_8E42_6708128E6634"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫As hard as I tried to fight it, I could not stop the mansion’s descent into disrepair."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Per quanto ci provassi, non riuscivo a fermare il deterioramento della villa."

#: scenario2:scenario2_A83B6CDB_837C_4075_B36A_BA8BA5F49E84
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 85d6b2df04118507b01d506bb513dfebcb8d8732a48ff96036fd95ab39f3ea5e
#. default-sha256: 2497ec1979fb62618663eb3b9152f3d928c23af9f560f7be99bc9e4607309337
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_A83B6CDB_837C_4075_B36A_BA8BA5F49E84"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The depth of the previous owner’s grief—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫or perhaps despair—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫was far too "
"much."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Il dolore del precedente proprietario—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫o forse la sua disperazione—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫"
"fu davvero troppo."

#: scenario2:scenario2_DDB7499B_52CF_4FD8_9D43_879A54A198F3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 63ccda0f617d01588a8bbe8405f3ea97914ba93f898375b4d34bc242a404bb4d
#. default-sha256: 585cfbb2a9d39a262c2b16cbb215b38b83fc4a8443f10fa809c5cd6924f9dfa4
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_DDB7499B_52CF_4FD8_9D43_879A54A198F3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫After the beautiful, flaxen-haired family, people stayed away from the mansion."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Dopo la bella famiglia dai capelli dorati, la gente restò alla larga dalla villa."

#: scenario2:scenario2_5B7D8B0A_B2BC_4EDE_BB71_1858CF8F3492
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c5d829fa3fed7821aebf06107c4221a7349a03bf7772c5478b8d0adbdb26b957
#. default-sha256: 35d3cdbc8d19ae4234b36684b6efeadc3b52f4b3e2b3e023267f12756bfd7167
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_5B7D8B0A_B2BC_4EDE_BB71_1858CF8F3492"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫They had no heirs, so their bloodline simply vanished into the depths of history."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Non avevano eredi, così la loro stirpe svanì nelle profondità della storia."

#: scenario2:scenario2_C32C96B2_91D2_4468_888D_DAFD14F4F1E4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c0067694924372816cc4c437480b31a057562ccc18e910abf0516ae03d2cd410
#. default-sha256: f1d9bfde42b3071a9c3fa53b488b9823efc4e974ec9d791d3cd3f5cc54afab97
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_C32C96B2_91D2_4468_888D_DAFD14F4F1E4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It had been about fifty years since the house last had a resident."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Trascorsero circa cinquant’anni dall’ultima volta in cui la casa aveva avuto dei residenti."

#: scenario2:scenario2_EC9547D8_3420_40FC_A5C2_6710453F891D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c5894aef08cb5e9c163d3133146fc168f7b498041b49f32f33eb92f783398904
#. default-sha256: ae9f25e7c88f401fe47d30519cdba5db9eb40299c7fe99125adb87d154536290
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_EC9547D8_3420_40FC_A5C2_6710453F891D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The forlorn property appeared as though it had been abandoned for centuries, and the "
"occasional villager who stumbled upon it did not remain there for more than a day."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La proprietà desolata appariva come se fosse stata abbandonata da secoli, e gli abitanti del "
"villaggio che occasionalmente ci si imbattevano non rimanevano lì per più di un giorno."

#: scenario2:scenario2_D9A1BB5C_BFAA_4114_84FC_B8B5D6C46B51
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e14ab2737e1d91f31878dd4b5d3ae043d3c8c6b53c694c96f3500b27f201c837
#. default-sha256: 71bae90a7f7e5b2d64fc2313d30b88c601f9f7c4d0aa1424c887842a6ff997c1
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_D9A1BB5C_BFAA_4114_84FC_B8B5D6C46B51"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫My time there was rather solitary. ⟪k:1⟫That was perhaps the loneliest time of my life."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Il mio tempo lì fu piuttosto solitario.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Probabilmente fu proprio il momento più "
"solitario della mia vita."

#: scenario2:scenario2_9AF8CEF9_75EC_4664_93E5_597CF93FECD9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 89588b1cc6c909f0d482c780c25cbfdc0affc5e2ebe403597bafc1975cfc81cd
#. default-sha256: 8021b7e0ca11a807e2f81133bc8afe77b8859c5d77443e310dfc308f680b5428
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_9AF8CEF9_75EC_4664_93E5_597CF93FECD9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Everyone who visited the mansion feared it, and it was left without anyone to become its "
"master."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Tutti coloro che avevano visitato la villa la temevano, e venne lasciata senza alcun padrone."

#: scenario2:scenario2_CE132600_052B_42F7_B729_A003A144D404
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e8c82c746d45daad02aeb3e62d61844b0a34c57cadf0374b93450a45ab54fe34
#. default-sha256: 7aa4125ca5beacbf507643036e0dac349bcd9d5c0a217ae6eb96390af4f88480
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_CE132600_052B_42F7_B729_A003A144D404"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I even came to believe that my time serving as a maid would come to an end in this era."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Giunsi persino a credere che il mio tempo come domestica sarebbe finito in quell’epoca."

#: scenario2:scenario2_E25C3AE2_1984_4498_A8D3_6FC852CBAB9B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a4829dcae924a167603da69d010a52064dbc43b7c256077bd3529ec1bf8f5976
#. default-sha256: 83e017118254b64cbc4580be67f044b6f327c6f3d52ec1fc53e15c5e8a76fe3d
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_E25C3AE2_1984_4498_A8D3_6FC852CBAB9B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫However, one day, I noticed something out of the ordinary."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Tuttavia, un giorno, notai qualcosa fuori dall’ordinario."

#: scenario2:scenario2_7214E523_D877_4548_937E_86CE27BDB472
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9d4b23345850f34cc107f15202d5c604e0749819c835c480a8bad1c12144639d
#. default-sha256: e982bfbb261ac0112d08f714d19aeed892bc179a46c17a4b3640c60c06284fd9
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_7214E523_D877_4548_937E_86CE27BDB472"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫As a servant of the house, I am almost immediately aware of any new presence within its "
"walls."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Come servitrice della casa, mi accorgo quasi immediatamente di qualunque nuova presenza "
"all’interno delle sue mura."

#: scenario2:scenario2_6F1BFE48_A06D_46EC_A469_FF0B76D4CD9B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3bb7290351f9c636f0919a856ee60f6e2b77f1ecae087b65ad65f5bfac5b6d70
#. default-sha256: 346da6bb743040bddc36249090c9d5c68a80078b84e9e97674bd5ed8d729f51a
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_6F1BFE48_A06D_46EC_A469_FF0B76D4CD9B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And there appeared to be someone downstairs."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫E sembrava esserci qualcuno al piano di sotto."

#: scenario2:scenario2_D8545916_B613_4B5C_ABBE_B1366C67A1CD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 88b18ef6d13e2aad20d19a6bb1a9580000e1eb1b1ad734f0b115b472fc352205
#. default-sha256: c9207024695bdc129e03c87fa13485b80f467667d79df7bc6bda5b9c28c85a2b
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_D8545916_B613_4B5C_ABBE_B1366C67A1CD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Can you imagine just how delighted I was?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Riesce a immaginare quanto fossi contenta?"

#: scenario2:scenario2_69BEEF25_929F_4661_AF3C_90866F4B2E90
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 529e169b2575f489719e1c96531901e122544d6773326f9c2a5e4b20c6a8fcb4
#. default-sha256: 0755198fd11d093561ce85bafda65ab1d14b74f45f1e07761e94bfa12d555c4a
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_69BEEF25_929F_4661_AF3C_90866F4B2E90"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Though part of me was anxious about what kind of person I might find, the "
"possibility that it could be you had my heart aflutter."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Anche se una parte di me era preoccupata per il tipo di persona che avrei potuto "
"incontrare, la possibilità che potesse essere lei, Padrone, mi fece battere il cuore."

#: scenario2:scenario2_6C7365BA_1923_450C_B94F_377563A07BE8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6a70eeaa311fec89f5ddcd5d301b214882085a23d97c2d25c1979111f38e29fb
#. default-sha256: 59de3ccee1a412f4b449f29bfd4c74cf4c010a3a6f6cf86914b1c2c4e356ba30
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_6C7365BA_1923_450C_B94F_377563A07BE8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫So, resisting the urge to rush, I headed for the basement."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Così, resistendo all’impulso di correre, mi diressi verso il seminterrato."

#: scenario2:scenario2_CE61E984_96CF_4238_8371_127CE64F6C26
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cfac3a3cfb7345e6f371dc22a02628482ac2af21a823da10f1c0d5986a04664f
#. default-sha256: 7d0d869086f12dd01541d744c658ef268276f7505e65b31fb110c50557a2c1b3
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_CE61E984_96CF_4238_8371_127CE64F6C26"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The cellar was where red wine, smoked meat, and other preserved foods were kept."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La cantina era dove venivano custoditi vino rosso, carne affumicata⟪k:1⟫e altre conserve."

#: scenario2:scenario2_A03F0CB8_6422_45D1_B7A7_7BDEE4AE1CF3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7eacde88f2240513381adbd6c32f2a3c3c5b79e00293c8b93951d2d4454c0911
#. default-sha256: 7c6b7bb64a7995adc1c466804c237f5ef0b2991aecef32816faaca27c2f0a8cb
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_A03F0CB8_6422_45D1_B7A7_7BDEE4AE1CF3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫By that point, the wine was practically antique."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫A quel punto, il vino era praticamente invecchiato."

#: scenario2:scenario2_A707287C_4268_4201_AD01_8C51EBCA5674
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e05691085d26fc557e4c9e7869f08d7c64d2d630923dffdeefaabf0a591692fe
#. default-sha256: 2370d386b3c98b6b28891ebde02b071a588a6ab4f0c0f9fe4078ae069d7a0e9a
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_A707287C_4268_4201_AD01_8C51EBCA5674"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫As I had expected, a man had made his way into the cellar."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Come mi aspettavo, un uomo si era introdotto in cantina."

#: scenario2:scenario2_E541ED9E_4B76_4D69_BF7A_FC22D5BAE705
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 652d8b6ff9b2e2ae7b5414b82d36e3febc8f230ce9148a4e85ce4636fe451380
#. default-sha256: 186b3335fda7fc1c6cd6a295c992ac2dd365a313b1c830aded0929fe7227b5ff
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_E541ED9E_4B76_4D69_BF7A_FC22D5BAE705"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Is anyone there?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫C’è qualcuno?"

#: scenario2:scenario2_ACB2E755_72C6_499A_9271_5E1ECBA33911
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f478972e867c3f2955f63dfbf1a738f29a406ac877217de8047378fd97b5e60f
#. default-sha256: ff2698ea5ec985b9399e5987eaad0c2bb88cbf4b3fb9590aaf4fc9560112391b
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_ACB2E755_72C6_499A_9271_5E1ECBA33911"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Although, I am unsure if referring to him as a “man” is entirely accurate."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Tuttavia, non sono sicura che riferirsi a lui come ad un “uomo” sia del tutto corretto."

#: scenario2:scenario2_3A93706E_89F4_4CA8_9521_8C4E07974C4C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 79f22b0305b66be45e7ead615937526eb6440a0a230649346e31c95a5ab33f39
