msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The very first thing I sensed was an almost unbearable stench."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫La prima cosa che notai fu il fetore quasi insopportabile."

#: scenario2:scenario2_29CF1136_6DBF_4845_85A3_1D0EB75DE064
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1915ae978f8a9d2cd98600d8ff614bb2e0eb8da747bb03b8759bdf2229874371
#. default-sha256: be255f1f12d43b9d6d9ac0b9771fb15b18b132353609003f021bc98cb8e095d9
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_29CF1136_6DBF_4845_85A3_1D0EB75DE064"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The odor emanated from the man, heightened by the food he had carelessly rummaged through."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫L’odore emanato dall’uomo, accentuato dal cibo nel quale aveva distrattamente rovistato."

#: scenario2:scenario2_C1CF5EED_D967_46E3_BAEA_7D481DC2FF5C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 291ea3829fdf61214d1cfc11ae117f7f038728e3f5a2cbd9d0b261bed06cb899
#. default-sha256: c2ceafc210e142815b4fef587622a015bf6064db2b67d0dd205ea973b18cdd04
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_C1CF5EED_D967_46E3_BAEA_7D481DC2FF5C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Blood-red liquid spilled from wine barrels, soaking the floor."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Un liquido rosso sangue fuoriusciva dalle botti di vino, impregnando il pavimento."

#: scenario2:scenario2_4791847B_28A8_437F_8D8C_3EDEA8044954
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 632a0d4920d58c7074f3744ae75440503057be25d125fffe82656756f5ec2188
#. default-sha256: 54e939000f3cefda9536197a6b19e432f2b4aa53888dcd1431b618c7544fec55
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_4791847B_28A8_437F_8D8C_3EDEA8044954"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫His sunken eyes had a piercing, wolf-like glimmer in them. His teeth were sharp and "
"yellowed, visible as he ripped into a chunk of meat. He grumbled in a seemingly inhuman tongue."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫I suoi occhi infossati avevano un penetrante barlume simile a quelli⟪k:1⟫di un lupo. I suoi "
"denti erano acuminati e ingialliti, ben visibili mentre azzannava un pezzo di carne."

#: scenario2:scenario2_787445AC_69E8_4BEF_85E0_8BF1246C9160
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 18d29952526be065f8ce81a7747568201d78ad2d4cf729f9ad8491d0052547ce
#. default-sha256: 131b2d3b0043ced34d8b24c4c94e5ea6482e18dc39ff73f4a0dbbe47f6547f36
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_787445AC_69E8_4BEF_85E0_8BF1246C9160"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I was looking at a beast. ⟪k:1⟫Or perhaps a half-beast."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Brontolava in una lingua apparentemente non umana.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ciò che avevo davanti era una "
"bestia. ⟪k:3⟫O forse una mezza bestia."

#: scenario2:scenario2_EE2EB011_CDA1_42B1_A23F_F07DB21EC612
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2db8c3510d64f8fb776a39ce82948b214539f47e32b2b4ffb8b18a0b01db9c5d
#. default-sha256: 14df7597ae00c924cdf5abf90156ce68f904854b721862f0529c21bb215b50d3
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_EE2EB011_CDA1_42B1_A23F_F07DB21EC612"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫There was another source of odor in the room, though. ⟪k:1⟫It had something of a kind of "
"metallic tinge to it, and when I noticed this..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫C’era un’altra fonte di odore nella stanza, tuttavia.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Aveva una sorta di sfumatura "
"metallica, e quando capii da dove proveniva..."

#: scenario2:scenario2_86319B00_68D9_4163_A412_19DCA6EF73B0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3b6ce953bc5c88542d54efdf810ee538af8a7e3ca5f08f051d8a4abb6dd62cce
#. default-sha256: 284ea1bddbd0fac938245daf3286c28b88d5651189bf9b872a90d6f4f0e09962
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_86319B00_68D9_4163_A412_19DCA6EF73B0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I nearly passed out. ⟪k:1⟫The red liquid was not just wine, as I had assumed."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫quasi svenni. ⟪k:1⟫Il liquido rosso non era soltanto vino, come avevo inizialmente pensato."

#: scenario2:scenario2_D3C60F28_EB03_4988_99D9_441C3CFBB376
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 87e14ef36f8fe2f21cf110afcc8e5df9975721eb76daee11222028db00de9a2e
#. default-sha256: 64221acb055609f7a6f7a6fe05ae8cc4d57f2145c0206c23cbf935f0efb8ed89
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_D3C60F28_EB03_4988_99D9_441C3CFBB376"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The beast had, I presume, stolen a weapon from the village. ⟪k:1⟫A sword far too nice for "
"him lay on the floor by his side."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Presumo che la bestia avesse rubato un’arma dal villaggio,⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫perché distesa sul "
"pavimento c’era una spada fin troppo bella per lui."

#: scenario2:scenario2_38461A89_9CBA_4005_AD1F_4233F9E2576D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4d4c874dd5fe230936188d1d19ccb41dabc1b59dec9a15a6e139ed363bc11536
#. default-sha256: 336b72dc91a289a75299cd05044a15aa0803496b36ac013f9c730fbb631ed210
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_38461A89_9CBA_4005_AD1F_4233F9E2576D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I could hardly imagine how many people’s lives he had taken with that blade. ⟪k:1⟫It was "
"visibly wet with blood, even in the darkness of the cellar. But at the same time, it had an "
"imposing gleam."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Difficilmente avrei potuto immaginare quante vite avesse tolto con quella lama. ⟪k:1⟫"
"Nonostante il buio della cantina, era visibilmente pregna di sangue. Ma allo stesso tempo emanava "
"un bagliore imponente."

#: scenario2:scenario2_EF164A91_D207_49DC_8E9D_0D0B1BD3C129
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 80ef7f30696d0d1ae0707d55a0f54247fb32891a3a7a65f61e2e45bb9753b21a
#. default-sha256: a2b8ba07905509d1fa7bc70043e0c7a1f08ea42edc37ffa08b9577e383db5402
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_EF164A91_D207_49DC_8E9D_0D0B1BD3C129"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The fine, luscious aroma of the wine could not mask the stench of blood and the beast."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫L’aroma fine e seducente del vino non riusciva a mascherare il puzzo del sangue e della "
"bestia."

#: scenario2:scenario2_5F608901_79E3_4B7E_BD17_37AEED323F52
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dfb94b6a9aa2c7b8ff9f6bfaa3a8872b2527c55a4efa2cf71f079d8af34efadc
#. default-sha256: 60c2e928fff8f56a6bb7f1e37423191764e4d2c099480e7ac9c034a334eccc93
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_5F608901_79E3_4B7E_BD17_37AEED323F52"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Holding my breath, I took a few moments to ponder."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Trattenendo il respiro, mi presi alcuni minuti per riflettere."

#: scenario2:scenario2_83074F67_A2B5_4144_B7B8_320B30871810
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b02542cbbb792d19a5e8b49ad7e67696df21301a8964a26a1f6a7f9d36f56a1f
#. default-sha256: 604cfb21d12ad84984b2dba28880a22a5ada60f3b948d8bb8cff9519ea3d703f
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_83074F67_A2B5_4144_B7B8_320B30871810"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Ponder what? Oh, Master, you know..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Riflettere su cosa? Beh, sa, Padrone..."

#: scenario2:scenario2_1EAEFECD_C07A_4E3B_8710_6CB30692A555
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
