#: scenario2:scenario2_1FABC048_0534_40E7_AE1B_D5E05A510E40
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d7691144b463272c49338ecd7e60e2dd8b68fd7587df5505ddb5bc1c8ac8e15b
