msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_1FABC048_0534_40E7_AE1B_D5E05A510E40"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Hehehe... ⟪k:2⟫If you are in want of money,⟪k:3⟫you are welcome to help yourself to "
"some of the furniture."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Hehehe... ⟪k:2⟫Se hai bisogno di soldi, prendi qualche oggetto d’arredamento da questa "
"casa."

#: scenario2:scenario2_A19A649D_7D2C_46B7_9965_43957FE64E32
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c38605057e22a86203adb53d0ba1016c603a9f6c75f2e97e5815c31520c94fe9
#. default-sha256: 2c1e6a58b1aaf2bec4b00a7a0092da5f2dfd306a094459dcfa3176c46667d17a
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_A19A649D_7D2C_46B7_9965_43957FE64E32"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And I imagine the villagers would be willing to welcome you if you dressed yourself up a bit "
"more like a person."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫E credo che gli abitanti del villaggio sarebbero disposti ad accoglierti se ti vestissi un "
"po’ più come una persona."

#: scenario2:scenario2_9CBFA70E_BF3B_41E0_92AD_3405B8B0BB40
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 034006972bdac2423095af529fc1116bb2a07acf0011ca0a1cde5b8ab5647d6c
#. default-sha256: a3adef8c7ae5e4435caabb174fd5577ac0d2f89ff2e0c17693d79945a87c4ffd
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_9CBFA70E_BF3B_41E0_92AD_3405B8B0BB40"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Then you can trade the furniture for food and make your way to a larger town."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫A quel punto potrai scambiare gli oggetti per del cibo e dirigerti verso una città più "
"grande."

#: scenario2:scenario2_09FA6E26_55EC_4C14_B749_4E1127F1A700
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5457ff85559dbae0d3af038751edd5485cdb87890646286d1fdb74c5b0367bc2
#. default-sha256: 3eced98b65e9bf29c72f8078a872af475d83bdd3b0b0de7fa6d2de39b6d1c4bd
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_09FA6E26_55EC_4C14_B749_4E1127F1A700"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The wolf was able to fool the innocent little girl simply by putting on clothing, after "
"all."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Dopotutto, il lupo riuscì ad ingannare la bambina innocente semplicemente indossando "
"degli abiti."

#: scenario2:scenario2_9A7CABD4_9FCA_4415_BCF5_165DA3437AC0
